This is A Simple TO-DO list application

This will work on Classes, Lists, Constructors and Local Date/Time.

-Works directly in the terminal
-Add/Delete To-Do Tasks
-Display Tasks in A minimal String/GUI
-Display time and update options
-Each task will have a delete/edit
-Each task will display: the task itself, date initialized, date to complete by and options.
-The main display will show the date, tasks, whose taskbook it is, the title "taskbook",
and options available at the bottom
-The user will move around with arrow keys and enter, and be automatically directed after selection
-The application needs tests for every method

WHAT IT NEEDS TO DO
-The application has to display the main page, with the tasks,
-display the options,
-allow for keyboard and enter movement in the terminal,
-only allow keyboard movement and enter
-allow typing only when expected
-allow for exiting the app
-allow for entering the app
-display the time and update
-display the main page and use string as a sort of GUI.
-update the time from the last time the application was opened


